- grep for Python heredoc patterns in doctor/sensors — zero matches

Output contract:
Start with exactly PASS or FAIL. Include at most 3 findings using [BLOCKER], [HIGH], [MED], [LOW]. Include exactly one REVIEW_VERDICT: PASS|FAIL line.

